WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:03.600
An oak struck by lightning
beside a lake house.

2
00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:07.140
A small traveller
watches, seen from behind.

3
00:00:07.190 --> 00:00:10.650
An Alpine valley under
a white dome of snow.

4
00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:12.370
His shoulders lift.

5
00:00:12.420 --> 00:00:16.420
A boat on the Rhine, past
vineyards and ruined castles.

6
00:00:16.470 --> 00:00:19.630
Then a ship, held fast in Arctic ice.

7
00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:21.500
Now he is slumped.

8
00:00:21.550 --> 00:00:23.560
Mountains heal Victor.

9
00:00:23.610 --> 00:00:25.200
Ice kills him.

10
00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:27.230
So what is nature doing?

11
00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:29.780
In this mission, you'll meet the sublime:

12
00:00:29.830 --> 00:00:34.940
vast, rugged, powerful, "so
beautiful yet terrific".

13
00:00:34.990 --> 00:00:39.770
You'll see why that cold, wet
summer of 1816 in the Alps matters.

14
00:00:39.820 --> 00:00:43.410
And you'll find the Romantic
poems hidden inside the novel.

15
00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:46.550
Your mission: work out
what nature is doing.
